# REQUIRES: python-api
# The frame evaluator (D240, docs/python-frames.md) on the
# CPU, in double and mixed precision, Inputs/python_frames.py: the energy
# that the forces sample, its derivative in the tunables, the virial, and
# the observed columns at stored frames against the sampler's own
# gradient() and state at each; frames of a run under a barostat, each with
# its cell; the vector-Jacobian product with the Jacobian kept and by a
# second pass against central differences in the tunables; the derivative
# of a reweighted average of a Lennard-Jones mixture against central
# differences of the reweighted average; and what is refused.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/pair_tail_system.py %t 60 60 32 3.7 0.5
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_frames.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide frames CPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=FRAMES -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_frames.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide frames CPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=FRAMES,DEFAULT -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_frames.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide npt CPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=NPT -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_frames.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide npt CPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=NPT -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_frames.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide refusals CPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=REFUSALS
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_frames.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide mixture CPU Double %t | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MIXTURE -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_frames.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide mixture CPU Mixed %t | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MIXTURE -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# FRAMES: [[MODE]]: 5 frames against the sampler's gradient() and state: {{.*}} equal to the bit: True
# FRAMES: [[MODE]]: as an array, in another order, from a generator, and one frame alone, equal to the bit: True
# FRAMES: [[MODE]]: positions in float32 change the energy by at most
# FRAMES: [[MODE]]: the product against the rows {{.*}}, by a second pass
# FRAMES: [[MODE]]: the product against central differences in theta of the sum of the energies
# DEFAULT: [[MODE]]: without the deterministic mode, the energy
# FRAMES: frames passed
# NPT: [[MODE]]: 4 frames of a run under a barostat, volumes {{.*}} equal to the bit: True
# NPT: [[MODE]]: against a simulation compiled from the frame: the energy
# NPT: [[MODE]]: with a net charge of 0.5 e and sigma scaled by 1.01, the product against central differences of the energies at the volume of each frame
# NPT: npt passed
# REFUSALS: refused: shapes, types, no frames, a position that is not finite, a cell below twice the cutoff, tilts in an orthorhombic program, a frame whose evaluation fails; the evaluator stays usable
# REFUSALS: refused: a generator when the Jacobian passes its bound, a product without the derivative, a second pass after the values changed
# REFUSALS: refusals passed
# MIXTURE: [[MODE]]: at the values that sampled, the energies equal the reference to the bit and the weights are uniform: True; N_eff = 150.000000 of 150
# MIXTURE: [[MODE]]: sigma' = 0.370 nm, N_eff = 150.0: the derivative of the reweighted average
# MIXTURE: [[MODE]]: sigma' = 0.372 nm, N_eff =
# MIXTURE: mixture passed
